## On the fidelity claims

Upstream's router swaps the **system prompt** persona and gates the **tool
catalog** per stage, and its published figures (cache-hit rate, routing
accuracy, convergence) were measured under those conditions on DSH.

This port can do neither: ZCode exposes no system-prompt hook and no hook
that adds or removes tools. The port therefore conditions only through
near-field context and reports the stage without gating tools.

Upstream's measured figures **do not transfer to this port**, and this
project does not claim them. See "Fidelity" in the README.
